WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:12.047
Customers keeps everyone you sell to in one place, people and businesses, with what they’ve bought and every conversation. In this video, you’ll find a customer, see their history, and log a call.

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:21.517
Open Customers. Each row shows the customer, whether they’re a person or a business, their status, what they’ve spent, and their last purchase.

00:00:21.967 --> 00:00:29.540
Search and filter by status, lead, active or inactive, and by tags or owner. Add customer brings in someone new.

00:00:30.533 --> 00:00:35.632
Open one for their contact details, address, notes, tags, and who looks after them.

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:45.645
Everything they buy is here too: purchases, subscriptions, and orders, with the total spent and their last purchase. Each order links straight to Order Tracking.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:54.868
Log activity records calls, meetings, emails and notes, next to the promo emails they were sent, so anyone can pick up where you left off.

00:00:55.333 --> 00:01:04.400
Owners and tags help you split customers up, like regulars, catering clients, or businesses on a monthly invoice, so the right person follows up.

00:01:04.867 --> 00:01:12.184
Customers is where Order Tracking and Engagement start. Archive customers you no longer work with, and they stay on record.

